t, open-plan living and dining area designed for family gatherings and entertaining<br> Modern fitted kitchen with ample storage and counter space<br> Private landscaped garden — ideal for outdoor dining, children’s play, or quiet evenings at home<br> Covered parking for multiple vehicles<br> Large windows throughout, filling the home with natural light<br> Contemporary architectural facade with premium finishes and a functional, family-friendly layout<br> Generous plot size offering excellent potential for garden landscaping or a future pool<br><br> Community Features: Emaar South is a master-planned community built around an 18-hole championship golf course, offering residents a lifestyle centered on green open spaces, wellness, and connectivity. The community features scenic parks, dedicated cycling and jogging tracks, a vibrant retail boulevard, nurseries and schools, mosques, and healthcare facilities — all designed to support a balanced, family-oriented way of life. Strategically located along Emirates Road, Emaar South places residents just minutes from Al Maktoum International Airport, Expo City Dubai, and major highways connecting to the rest of Dubai, making daily commutes and travel effortless.<br> <br> Available for viewing, contact us to schedule a visit and experience this exceptional home in person.<br> ","longitude":null,"negotiator_id":"521","negotiator_mapping":"alwin@providentestate.com","parking":["2"],"price":295000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"4-bedroom-villa-to-rent-in-fairway-villas-emaar-south-dubai-south-dubai-world-central-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/af0/af0d1f57eea0d1e22c73522a64555533/PHOTO_2026_04_13_15_48_00.jpg","title":"4 bedroom villa to rent","extra":{"views":"","cheques":"1","project":null,"bitrix_id":"1482541","furnished":"Unfurnished","permit_number":"65451528095","rental_period":"Yearly","current_status":"","furni